    m_Alignment: 3
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Hello!

    In this game you need to be attentive and calculating, each
    wave from the right side the enemy shoots colored cores at the king of balls,
    you buy troops with shields to protect the king, the troops are not simple, you
    should click on them and change the colors to match the enemy cores, if the colors
    match, then the shield protects the king, otherwise the shield is destroyed and
    damages the king, after the death of the king the game ends, each wave the speed
    of the colored cores increases, you need to be quick and attentive and have time
    to buy new shields.

    Good luck, I hope you get lucky'
